days short leg rejected/forced flat: 25/60 (no-borrow 10 + after recall 15)
borrow fee paid (sum)=0.00556; dividend owed on day 35=0.00400 of NAV
=== 2. unlimited-loss shape of a short ===
stock +50%: long loses at most 100% if it goes to 0; short of 1 share @50 loses 25 (no cap)
stock +100%: long loses at most 100% if it goes to 0; short of 1 share @50 loses 50 (no cap)
stock +300%: long loses at most 100% if it goes to 0; short of 1 share @50 loses 150 (no cap)
=== 3. Reg SHO layers (different duties) ===
Rule 200    : mark order long / short / short exempt
Rule 203(b) : broker locate before short sale (reasonable grounds to borrow)
Rule 201    : price test after >=10% one-day drop (rest of day + next day), not a halt
Rule 204    : clearing participants close out fails to deliver
-> a local mask is a teaching constraint, NOT legal compliance; a locate is not a guaranteed borrow
disclaimer: synthetic; learning only
